* **View:** images, audio, video, PDF, text, **Markdown** and **ODT** open right in the browser; audio and video can be seeked (range support).

* **Share:** admin shares reach everyone, teachers their classes (never other teachers), students only chosen recipients. Files not shared are only a 404 for others.
* The **"Shared with me"** section shows what others shared with you, with its own empty state.
* One **search field for both tables** filters your own and shared files together; it searches name, type, owner and the "shared" text — not the file content.